% Supports: CST recorded an average of 5 antisemitic incidents a day in the UK
% from 1 January to 6 October 2023 and 31 a day from 7 October to 31 December
% 2023; the single-day peak was 80 incidents on 11 October 2023, the highest
% number ever reported to CST on a single day. (The 2023 annual total, 4,103 in
% this report, was revised upward in later CST reports; the intro does not use it.)
% Checked via web search restricted to cst.org.uk (report PDF and CST blog post
% of 15 Feb 2024), Nov 2026. Direct fetch of cst.org.uk is blocked from this
% session.
%
% Facts used from cst2026incidents (CST report on 2025, bib/sources.bib),
% checked the same way: 40 incidents were logged on each of 2 and 3 October
% 2025, the day of the attack on Heaton Park Synagogue (Manchester) and the day
% after, the highest daily totals of 2025; 42 of these 80 (53%) were
% antisemitic reactions to the attack, 39 of them witnessed online.
